{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/018-key-buddy/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Wood Times"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"861994c1-bb61-54d5-996b-d8c4ca8a0b28","excerpt":"Some projects start with a piece of wood that’s too beautiful not to use. I’d been holding onto a board of birdseye maple, waiting for the right project. A key…","html":"<p>Some projects start with a piece of wood that’s too beautiful not to use. I’d been holding onto a board of birdseye maple, waiting for the right project. A key holder for the kitchen turned out to be the answer.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/d390129169dffb1e44a4706987395562/493ac/board_top.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Board Top\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/d390129169dffb1e44a4706987395562/f058b/board_top.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/d390129169dffb1e44a4706987395562/c26ae/board_top.png 158w,\n/static/d390129169dffb1e44a4706987395562/6bdcf/board_top.png 315w,\n/static/d390129169dffb1e44a4706987395562/f058b/board_top.png 630w,\n/static/d390129169dffb1e44a4706987395562/40601/board_top.png 945w,\n/static/d390129169dffb1e44a4706987395562/78612/board_top.png 1260w,\n/static/d390129169dffb1e44a4706987395562/493ac/board_top.png 4032w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>The birdseye figure in this maple was exceptional - those distinctive “eyes” scattered across the grain like stars. I shaped the board with rounded edges and recessed hanger hardwared along the back for mounting flush.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/6b52947e15f071e703918fba6f8367c6/493ac/birdseye_detail.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Birdseye Detail\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/6b52947e15f071e703918fba6f8367c6/f058b/birdseye_detail.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/6b52947e15f071e703918fba6f8367c6/c26ae/birdseye_detail.png 158w,\n/static/6b52947e15f071e703918fba6f8367c6/6bdcf/birdseye_detail.png 315w,\n/static/6b52947e15f071e703918fba6f8367c6/f058b/birdseye_detail.png 630w,\n/static/6b52947e15f071e703918fba6f8367c6/40601/birdseye_detail.png 945w,\n/static/6b52947e15f071e703918fba6f8367c6/78612/birdseye_detail.png 1260w,\n/static/6b52947e15f071e703918fba6f8367c6/493ac/birdseye_detail.png 4032w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>Up close, the birdseye pattern is mesmerizing. These figure patterns are caused by unusual growth conditions and are relatively rare, making pieces like this worth showcasing rather than hiding in a drawer.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/3fc8a390d6607235edfe9e29cc84412f/493ac/installed.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Installed\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/3fc8a390d6607235edfe9e29cc84412f/f058b/installed.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/3fc8a390d6607235edfe9e29cc84412f/c26ae/installed.png 158w,\n/static/3fc8a390d6607235edfe9e29cc84412f/6bdcf/installed.png 315w,\n/static/3fc8a390d6607235edfe9e29cc84412f/f058b/installed.png 630w,\n/static/3fc8a390d6607235edfe9e29cc84412f/40601/installed.png 945w,\n/static/3fc8a390d6607235edfe9e29cc84412f/78612/installed.png 1260w,\n/static/3fc8a390d6607235edfe9e29cc84412f/493ac/installed.png 4032w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>Mounted in the kitchen with a simple metal hook rail, the key buddy serves its purpose beautifully. Keys have a home, and every time you grab them you get to appreciate that stunning wood grain.</p>\n<p>Sometimes the simplest projects are the most satisfying - take a beautiful piece of wood, shape it thoughtfully, and let it do what it does best: look amazing while being useful.</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"Key Buddy","date":"February 16, 2019","description":null}},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/017-stereo-cozy/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Stereo Cozy"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/019-3d-camera-handle/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"3D Camera Handle"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"861994c1-bb61-54d5-996b-d8c4ca8a0b28","previousPostId":"c7e6dd2c-8dcc-5396-b7d2-acdb0935e8dd","nextPostId":"3ed4782e-4d10-5146-8975-c53ced6b272d"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2841359383"],"slicesMap":{}}